  step,dige:46f0d4746b79dccf
  step=2,desc:load Atlas and Lagoon on demand — stand Atlas on the frozen corpus and the reader beside it,dige:8072b19f8378bd2f
  step=3,desc:open the hole — the head is a field to type into and the families stand around it,dige:2080d71d27accc4c
    Assertion:the-head-reads-what,sentence:the head reads what was typed and is the biggest bone of the creature
    Assertion:with-nothing-typed-the,sentence:with nothing typed the code families stand around the hole
  step=4,desc:type into the hole — one vertebra per file and its ribs the stem families holding hits,dige:f5b5f10d5e86dbb3
    Assertion:a-search-stands-as,sentence:a search stands as a spine — one vertebra per file stemmed by its directory
    Assertion:a-file-says-its,sentence:a file says its hits as stem families — and a family never crosses the bead its author drew
  step=5,desc:press the file — its methods in file order with a family named once and fused by stem,dige:55015c6ce8295590
    Assertion:a-file-is-its,sentence:a file is its methods in file order — a family names itself once and its members by what they add
    Assertion:a-family-wears-one,sentence:a family wears one stem so the glass fuses it — two families never share one
  step=6,desc:press a method — its code lands and the glass becomes its doors,dige:b14e8700fe4bd559
    Assertion:pressing-a-method-lands,sentence:pressing a method lands its code — the face is told and the glass folds to a rail
    Assertion:a-method-is-a,sentence:a method is a place with doors — what it calls and its family — and an empty door is not drawn
  step=7,desc:press what it calls — the walk lands in that method and its door back is its caller,dige:640cce9245235350
    Assertion:pressing-what-it-calls,sentence:pressing what it calls walks there — and the door back is the caller
  step=8,desc:press the head — the rope climbs back one step,dige:e756733689a3ea56
    Assertion:a-click-on-the,sentence:a click on the head seeks the box and climbs — the head used to be the box
    Assertion:the-head-is-the,sentence:the head is the rope — pressing it climbs back one step
  step=9,dige:28a78e6fed5ab60a,desc:climb past the surface — the seeker leaves and the cave tells the face
    Assertion:climbing-past-the-surface,sentence:climbing past the surface leaves the cave — and the face is told
